.TH DANBY-AMUSEMENTCHAOS 1
.SH NAME
danby-amusementchaos \- driven nonlinear amusement-ride pendulum
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/amusementchaos
.SH MODEL
A damped nonlinear pendulum is forced directly and through periodic pivot
motion.  Drive amplitude and frequency permit transitions from periodic motion
through period multiplication to sensitive chaotic response.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/amusementchaos.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
